<title>USA: QuadraMed Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>QuadraMed Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LARKSPUR, Calif. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							 Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						    March 31,    March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>    Licenses					 $4,163	 $4,026</p>
